{
  "name": "01 \u2014 KB Sync (Products Sheet \u2192 Pinecone RAG)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 1 \u2014 KB Sync to Pinecone\n\n**Purpose:** Read Products from Google Sheet, clean each row into a searchable document, embed via OpenAI, and upsert to Pinecone. Run on demand or on schedule.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Replace `REPLACE_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` in Get Products node.\n2. Create Pinecone index `fb-chatbot-kb` (dim=1536, cosine).\n3. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI, Pinecone.\n4. Run manually once, then keep schedule active for daily sync.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "66466d27-2f06-475f-9d79-d253d98d5bb0",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "2ddc0e17-318f-4dba-91e1-44661469cab5",
      "name": "Run Manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 3 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "0a40c579-7869-4b86-b108-3bd2686a059b",
      "name": "Daily Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
